# 2026-11-04, one by-hand Galaxy S26 hold (not page rows: the campaign name holds no `dashboard`, so the dashboard
# page never reads it as a weekly sitting): litert-community/Qwen3.5-0.8B (Qwen3.5-0.8B_int8.litertlm, Hub main LFS
# sha256 25447e25..., 964,566,992 B, unchanged since 2026-10-16) on three prefill counts around the file's prefill
# signatures (17 = 16 + 1, 1023 = 1024 - 1, 1025 = 1024 + 1), decode 256, context 2048: the protocol row
# native-benchmark-1024x256 (methodology/agreed-protocol-gemma4.md "The spec") with the prefill count moved, i.e.
# litert_lm_advanced_main --benchmark --benchmark_prefill_tokens=<P> --benchmark_decode_tokens=256
# --max_num_tokens=2048 (android/bench/run_cell.py engine_command). LiteRT-LM GPU on the side build v0.19.0-pregpu
# (android/engine-pins.json: LiteRT-LM v0.19.0 at the Android pin's commit with Google's prebuilt GPU accelerator,
# loaded at run time; engine_version v0.19.0), the build of the page's Galaxy S26 x Qwen3.5-0.8B GPU row
# (results/raw/2026-11-04-dashboard-v1-s26-d541q35b-android). These rows = the GPU row of
# matrices/d541-qwen35-s26-android.cells with the task's prefill count changed.
# The session anchor rows run before this file as their own campaign (matrices/anchors.cells, its two Android rows), so
# this file holds no anchor row. No runs= (the runner's default of 3 runs per row, round by round: 17, 1023, 1025,
# 17, ...), no cooldown= (the runner's 120 s, the 0.6B / 1.7B class: docs/dashboard-cells-v1.md).
# Estimate: one launch = 120 s cooldown + up to 112 s of GPU engine creation (65-112 s, 10 of the 12 programs
# rebuilt from DATA_LOSS each launch) + about 15 s, so about 37 min for the nine launches.
android litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3.5-0.8B native-benchmark-17x256 backend=gpu engine-build=v0.19.0-pregpu file=Qwen3.5-0.8B_int8.litertlm context-tokens=2048
android litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3.5-0.8B native-benchmark-1023x256 backend=gpu engine-build=v0.19.0-pregpu file=Qwen3.5-0.8B_int8.litertlm context-tokens=2048
android litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3.5-0.8B native-benchmark-1025x256 backend=gpu engine-build=v0.19.0-pregpu file=Qwen3.5-0.8B_int8.litertlm context-tokens=2048
